sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client (RESTCONF)
  participant N as NSO (CDB + transaction)
  participant A as ios0
  participant B as xr0
  participant J as junos0
  C->>N: POST /restconf/data (service T25-LO100)
  N->>N: FASTMAP runs mapping → 3 device diffs
  par prepare on every device
    N->>A: CLI: interface Loopback100 ...
    N->>B: CLI: interface Loopback100 ...
    N->>J: edit-config (candidate)
  end
  alt every device OK
    N->>N: write service + device config to CDB
    N-->>C: 201 Created (+ rollback id)
  else any device fails (e.g. xr0 unreachable)
    N->>A: send reverse (no interface Loopback100)
    N->>J: discard-changes
    N-->>C: error · CDB and all devices unchanged
  end
